{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321402001:1":{"text":"おばあさんは地元の方ですよね！？カミンスキー家について何か知りませんか？","source_cn":"奶奶，你一定是本地人吧！你有没有听说过卡明斯基家族？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x070381AAE442B386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321402002:1":{"text":"カミンスキー……どこかで聞いたような……","source_cn":"卡明斯基……这名字好熟悉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x006249AD66BF6C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321402003:1":{"text":"……ああ、思い出したべ。わたしが子どもの頃、確かにカミンスキー家という一族がいた。","source_cn":"……哦，我记起来了。我小的时候，镇上还有两家姓卡明斯基的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319AD95E31F70277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321402004:1":{"text":"でも、もうとっくに引っ越していったよ。わたしが十歳になる前のことだ……","source_cn":"不过，他们很早就搬走了，应该都是我十岁之前的事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAAE97BA6173ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321402004":{"text":"でも、もうとっくに引っ越していったよ。わたしが十歳になる前のことだ……","source_cn":"不过，他们很早就搬走了，应该都是我十岁之前的事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAAE97BA6173ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_ma